# Design exploration

When asked for **new designs** (variants to pick from):

1. Add a temporary route/page that shows all options in context (mock the real chrome).
2. **Register it** in `app/lib/debug-pages.ts` (`DEBUG_PAGES`: `{ path, label }`) so it appears in the DEV-only debug pages list (bottom-right, above the Debug button).
3. After a winner is chosen: implement it on the real page(s), then **delete** the temp route/page, unregister it from `routes.ts`, and **remove** it from `DEBUG_PAGES`.

Do not leave comparison pages around after a choice.

# Apple glass (preference)

Default design options toward Apple-style glass:

- Floating, inset from edges (not edge-flush chrome)
- Frosted translucency: `backdrop-blur` + light fill (`bg-white/10` range)
- Soft border (`border-white/20`) and specular highlight (`inset` top shine)
- Pill / continuous-corner shapes; restrained shadow

**Not mandatory.** If another treatment fits better, use that and say why briefly.

# Popups / hover cards / overlays

Every popup, hover card, menu, and floating overlay should use this **dense glass** surface — same look as glass cards. Match aesthetic only (background, border, blur, type, colors); do **not** copy a card’s content layout.

## Shell

- Shape: `rounded-2xl` (continuous corner); nested rows/items `rounded-lg`
- Border: `border border-white/20`
- Fill: `bg-zinc-900/80` (or card-style gradient `bg-linear-to-b from-white/14 to-white/6` when floating over busy chrome)
- Blur: `backdrop-blur-2xl backdrop-saturate-150`
- Shadow: `shadow-[0_12px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.45),inset_0_1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.28)]` (drop + top specular)
- Base text: `text-white`; strip default opaque / shadcn popover chrome (`ring-0` if needed)

## Type & color

- Labels / section headers: `text-[0.5625rem] font-medium uppercase tracking-wide text-white/50`
- Primary content: `text-[0.625rem]`–`text-xs` · `text-white/90`
- Secondary meta (sizes, counts): `text-[0.5625rem] tabular-nums text-white/40`
- Muted empty/loading: `text-white/50`

## Interaction

- Row hover: `hover:bg-white/10`
- Positive actions: emerald accents (e.g. `text-emerald-400 hover:bg-white/10`)
- Compact padding (`p-1.5` shell, tight row gaps) — dense, not airy panels
